  "description": "Play hard with the LXi 7.1 featuring 21 speeds and easy twist shifting. Go for a smooth and fast pedal on a light and nimble 6000 series aluminum frame with a step thru option matched to a 30mm hybrid suspension fork and fast rolling 700c wheels. LXi 7.1's comfortable upright frame teams up with a suspension seat post and height adjustable stem for a perfect fit, as well as a fast and comfortable ride.\nLightweight Del Sol 6061 aluminum frame with Step-Thru option\nUltra-forgiving 30mm travel suspension fork\nWide-range Shimano 21-speed Tourney drivetrain\nShimano TY301 crankset\n700c double wall rims, stainless steel spikes, and Kenda Komfort 700c x 38c tires\nCustom Del Sol comfort plush saddle\n130mm Suspension seatpost ensure a comfortable ride\nAdjustable rise alloy quill stem\nAlloy linear pull brakes",
